            'Narrow profiles provide less surface area for caulk adhesion and flashing integration; water management relies more heavily on concealed flashing and sealant quality.',
            'Design intent can read as "cheap" rather than "minimal" if trim width, material, and paint quality are not carefully coordinated; deliberate minimalism requires quality execution.'
