            'Contractor unfamiliar with flush-detail installation or unable to explain how thermal movement of cladding is managed at each opening demonstrates insufficient expertise.',
            'Window and door specifications that do not include frame depth coordination with finished cladding plane indicate a mismatch that will surface during installation.'
